{"catalogHash":"9b61e25e4b3ab6b03de3cdf4a596bd440566c4e37005c9524d39027c299eea8e","contract":"cerebro.node-modifier-detail/v2","definition":{"id":"nec_path_diau","versions":[{"applications":[{"evidence":{"coordinate":{"x":42,"y":45},"pointer":"/map/walkableTiles/327/defenderBuffs/4","sourceId":"map-c3cb045203ee79fcc186-2026eb5a"},"hash":"3019516bd06778c56857646aa0335c40692f4ae0e9f7d024c6bfafe42c41e3da","nativeIconKey":null,"observations":3,"raw":{"buffAmount":1,"buffAppearance":"","buffDescription":"The Defender has 3 cumulative phases that grant permanent additional effects in this fight.\nPhase 1 - Fight Start: At the start of the fight and every 18 seconds, the Defender picks 1 of 3 Alchemical Ingredients. When the Attacker throws a Light Attack it rotates the Attacker's dormant Alchemical Ingredient from Emberboon to Lifestitch and then Ironskin before repeating. Performing a Medium Combo Ender brews the dormant Alchemical Ingredient, replacing any existing one. A brewed Alchemical Ingredient can be consumed by dashing back and holding Block for 0.6 seconds. If the Alchemical Ingredient picked by the Defender is not consumed by the Attacker before the next one triggers, the Attacker is dealt a burst of Direct Damage equal to 15% of their max Health.\nPhase 2 - Defender goes below 70% Health: Consuming Alchemical Ingredients now requires the Attacker to dash back and hold Block for 1.2 seconds.\nPhase 3 - Defender goes below 40% Health: Alchemical Ingredients now take 3 seconds to brew before they can be consumed.","isExtra":false,"nodeSource":{"attk":false,"bt":[],"buffs":[{"Action":"","Data":"nec_path_diau","Footer":"","Header":"","MaxQuantity":1,"MinQuantity":1,"Quantity":1,"Type":"buff"}],"remainActive":false,"type":{"name":"Local","value":2}}},"text":"The Defender has 3 cumulative phases that grant permanent additional effects in this fight.\nPhase 1 - Fight Start: At the start of the fight and every 18 seconds, the Defender picks 1 of 3 Alchemical Ingredie